t_layer":"received_chapter","source_quote":{"witness":"han","quote":"朱雲字游，魯人也，徙平陵。","raw_start":2719,"raw_end":2732,"raw_line":24},"chapter_id":"c-hanshu-067-jin043-guoshu","book_id":"b-hanshu-067","work_id":"w-hanshu","source_id":"s-hanshu-067-jin043-guoshu"},{"id":"c-hanshu-067-jin043-guoshu:rail","text":"雲攀殿檻，檻折。","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"id":"c-hanshu-067-jin043-guoshu:rail:m0000","start":0,"end":1,"surface":"雲","kind":"person","person_id":"0f4_zc6_3l3","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"}],"text_layer":"received_chapter","source_quote":{"witness":"han","quote":"雲攀殿檻，檻折。","raw_start":4301,"raw_end":4309,"raw_line":32},"chapter_id":"c-hanshu-067-jin043-guoshu","book_id":"b-hanshu-067","work_id":"w-hanshu","source_id":"s-hanshu-067-jin043-guoshu"},{"id":"c-jinshu-043-guoshu:line137","text":"王敦召為參軍，轉從事中郎。襄陽都督周訪卒，敦遣舒監襄陽軍。甘卓至，乃還。朝廷征舒為右丞，敦留不遣。敦謀為逆，舒諫不從，使守武昌。荊州別駕宗澹忌舒才能，數譖之于王暠。暠疑舒與甘卓同謀，密以白敦，敦不受。高官督護繆坦嘗請武昌城西地為營，太守樂凱言於敦曰：「百姓久買此地，種菜自贍，不宜奪之。」敦大怒曰：「王處仲不來江湖，當有武昌地不，而人云是我地邪！」凱懼，不敢言。舒曰：「公聽舒一言。」敦曰：「平子以卿病狂，故掐鼻灸眉頭，舊疢復發邪！」舒曰：「古之狂也直，周昌、汲黯、硃雲不狂也。昔堯立誹謗之木，舜置敢諫之鼓，然後事無枉縱。公為勝堯、舜邪？乃逆折舒，使不得言。何與古人相遠！」敦曰：「卿欲何言？」舒曰：「繆坦可謂小人，疑誤視聽，奪人私地，以強陵弱。晏子稱：君曰其可，臣獻其否，以成其可。是以舒等不敢不言。」敦即使還地，眾咸壯之。敦重舒公亮，給賜轉豐，數詣其家。表為梁州刺史。病卒。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-043-guoshu:line137:m0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"王敦","kind":"person","person_id":"39o_b6y_n74","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-043-guoshu:line137:m0017","start":17,"end":19,"surface":"周訪","kind":"person","person_id":"c6b_s71_vt7","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-043-guoshu:line137:m0021","start":21,"end":22,"surface":"敦","kind":"person","person_id":"39o_b6y_n74","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-043-guoshu:line137:m0023","start":23,"end":24,"surface":"舒","kind":"person","person_id":"nyu_drp_roe","st